id":3053832,"name":"Badr Iffach","role":"Badr","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/unoieuhWVrh6RARO8YxH7YmHnzj.jpg"},{"id":1622994,"name":"Nicolas Chupin","role":"The music teacher","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dLP97PyuAlJz2vxHmBWg0rGiSlg.jpg"},{"id":3604264,"name":"Sheina Boudjema","role":"Kenza, Yanis' sister"},{"id":3604270,"name":"Toussaint Polidori","role":"The SEGPA teacher"},{"id":1404601,"name":"Natalie Beder","role":"Delphine, the visual arts teacher","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9leND2klyaR0bYgJ0vXTcfkFYEh.jpg"},{"id":3604272,"name":"Mohamed Ikharazen","role":"Mohamed"},{"id":3604277,"name":"Lamine Camara","role":"Patrick, Anne's companion"},{"id":1367047,"name":"Charlotte Talpaert","role":"Cindy's mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kqBjcyroKhfyj4LozMGGeCusSaD.jpg"},{"id":3604974,"name":"Zakaria-Tayeb Lazab","role":"Nordine","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iNmeF6so3BiEpEJ2gxpr9tiA12r.jpg"},{"id":3591888,"name":"Enzo Lemartinet","role":"The little"},{"id":3604987,"name":"Karidia Sanogo","role":"Fodé's mother"},{"id":3604989,"name":"Tewfiq Seghir","role":"Fat firefighter"},{"id":3604993,"name":"Fatima El Rhaffouli","role":"Arab mom"},{"id":1757018,"name":"Souad Flissi","role":"Canteen lady"},{"id":3151298,"name":"Manassé Kashala","role":"Karl","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f8vrzOcA7KDXc3nPh1kfoQnNKjd.jpg"},{"id":3605034,"name":"Vincent Doan","role":"Vincent","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AomDgDAa6nelsP02Jxj0sCwzcEw.jpg"},{"id":3605042,"name":"Aurélie Tessier","role":"Little teacher with glasses"},{"id":3605046,"name":"Hamid Bouffara","role":"Big cheeked teacher"},{"id":1651716,"name":"Georgina Elizabeth Okon","role":"Fodé's sister","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dIBVcyKota38gSpIBwaTXVoVBWy.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'anno che verrà","overview":"Samia, una giovane al primo importante impiego, arriva come consulente in una scuola della sua regione ritenuta da tutti \"difficile\". Qui, scopre i ricorrenti problemi di disciplina degli allievi, la realtà sociale del quartiere e le difficoltà, ma anche la vitalità e l'umorismo degli studenti e dei colleghi. La sua complicata situazione personale la avvicina sempre più a Yanis, studente insolente a cui vuole dare un futuro migliore.","tagline":"Il futuro è tra i banchi di scuola"},{"language":"en-US","title":"School Life","overview":"In one of the poorest areas of Paris, a school counselor devotes herself to working with disadvantaged students, while facing challenges of her own."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Une année au cœur de l’école de la république de la vie… et de la démerde! Samia, jeune CPE novice, débarque de son Ardèche natale dans un collège réputé difficile de la ville de Saint-Denis. Elle y découvre les problèmes récurrents de discipline, la réalité sociale pesant sur le quartier, mais aussi l’incroyable vitalité et l’humour, tant des élèves que de son équipe de surveillants. Parmi eux, il y a Moussa, le Grand du quartier et Dylan le chambreur. Samia s'adapte et prend bientôt plaisir à canaliser la fougue des plus perturbateurs. Sa situation personnelle compliquée la rapproche naturellement de Yanis, ado vif et intelligent, dont elle a flairé le potentiel. Même si Yanis semble renoncer à toute ambition en se cachant derrière son insolence, Samia va investir toute son énergie à le détourner d’un échec scolaire annoncé et tenter de l’amener à se projeter dans un avenir meilleur…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/daGRaIml3CA7N1o2ONvM2eN7c1E.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9LyPD0Kk0xfEcT8iydKDm2xYyGS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":587301,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster